[{"id":"fastapi-0141-orjson-migration","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"FastAPI","tags":["迁移","序列化"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(四)数据模型与响应契约.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(四)数据模型与响应契约","articlePath":"posts/ea590b49/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(四)数据模型与响应契约.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(四)数据模型与响应契约","articlePath":"posts/ea590b49/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>从 Pydantic v1 迁移到 v2 时，哪些模型调用应优先替换？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>优先把 \u003ccode>orm_mode\u003c/code> 换成 \u003ccode>from_attributes\u003c/code>，把 \u003ccode>dict()\u003c/code> 换成 \u003ccode>model_dump()\u003c/code>，把 \u003ccode>parse_obj()\u003c/code> 换成 \u003ccode>model_validate()\u003c/code>，再比较响应契约。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>这些替换改变的是模型配置和调用名称，不应顺手修改字段或状态码。迁移证据包括：同一 ORM fixture 能验证、同一输入的错误位置不变、JSON 日期/UUID 形状不变、OpenAPI Schema 没有无意漂移。\u003ccode>ORJSONResponse\u003c/code> 是独立的响应类选择，只有在明确需要时才加入，不能把它当成 v2 迁移的必选步骤。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"mysql84-06-deduplicate-row-number-p2","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"mysql-8.4-interview","tags":["ROW_NUMBER","去重","稳定排序"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(六)CTE与窗口函数.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(六)CTE与窗口函数","articlePath":"posts/6d8f8f0/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/mysql/MySQL(六)CTE与窗口函数.md","articleTitle":"MySQL(六)CTE与窗口函数","articlePath":"posts/6d8f8f0/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>按 \u003ccode>(source_name, external_id)\u003c/code> 去重，保留 id 最小的记录，如何写出可审计的 SQL？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cfigure class=\"highlight sql\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> id\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> (\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">SELECT\u003c/span> id, \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">ROW_NUMBER\u003c/span>() \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">OVER\u003c/span> (\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">PARTITION\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">BY\u003c/span> source_name, external_id \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">ORDER\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">BY\u003c/span> id) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> rn\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">FROM\u003c/span> user_imports_raw\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">AS\u003c/span> marked\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">WHERE\u003c/span> rn \u003cspan class=\"operator\">&gt;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"number\">1\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">ORDER\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">BY\u003c/span> id;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>ROW_NUMBER()\u003c/code> 的 \u003ccode>ORDER BY id\u003c/code> 同时承担“保留谁”的业务规则：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight text\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">同一 (source_name, external_id)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  id=10 → rn=1 → 保留\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  id=11 → rn=2 → 删除候选\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>先只 \u003ccode>SELECT rn &gt; 1\u003c/code> 预览，确认行数和业务键，再把相同窗口结果用于删除。清理后加唯一键防止复发；如果重复其实表示“同一外部对象的新版本”，应改用 UPSERT，而不是定时抹掉历史。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"testing-basics-scenario-refund-rules","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"测试基础","tags":["场景","退款","判定表"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(八)规则组合与判定测试.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(八)规则组合与判定测试","articlePath":"posts/ed62e469/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(八)规则组合与判定测试.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(八)规则组合与判定测试","articlePath":"posts/ed62e469/"}],"articleIndex":4,"articleCount":15,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>退款资格、时间和金额规则如何设计组合？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>把订单状态、申请时间、退款类型和已退款金额列成条件，覆盖可退、超时、部分退款和重复申请的状态结果。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>先固定教学假设：已支付且未完成售后的订单可申请，超出约定时间拒绝，部分退款不能超过可退余额。代表用例要检查订单、退款单和账户余额的一致性；网络超时或重复点击时，使用幂等键或查询结果确认是否已经处理。法律时限、真实支付和平台规则不能凭经验代入练习。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]